name: sim.setLongProperty
description: Sets an int64 property
luaSynopsis: sim.setLongProperty(int target, string propertyName, int propertyState, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: sim.setLongProperty(int target, string propertyName, int propertyState, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
